text = "[b]🎮 Controls:[/b]
  Arrow Keys or WASD — Move your bunny

[b]🥕 Collect:[/b]
  Orange Carrot = 10 points
  Golden Carrot = 25 points

[b]⚠ Avoid:[/b]
  🦊 Foxes — they move and hurt you!
  ⚫ Holes — don't fall in!
  🌵 Thorn Bushes — ouch!

[b]🎯 Goal:[/b]
  Collect enough points before the timer ends!
  Reach the required score to win the level.

[b]❤ Lives:[/b]
  You start with 3 lives. Each hit = -1 life.
  If lives reach 0, it's Game Over!"

